  "title": "Hagerty Elevates Marc Burns to CMO and Appoints Matt Teshera as SVP of Marketing - Hagerty",
  "summary": "TRAVERSE CITY, Mich. – February 9, 2026 /PRNewswire/ – Hagerty, Inc. (NYSE: HGTY) a business that makes it easier and more enjoyable to be a driving enthusiast through insurance, buying and selling platforms, publishing and events, has promoted Marc Burns to Chief Marketing Officer, and appointed Matt Teshera as SVP of Marketing. In this newly created role, Burns will […]",
